      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://107.170.91.122/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/postcard-2014-20140403_16494307_0001.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140403_16494307_0001&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;http://107.170.91.122/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/postcard-2014-20140403_16494307_0001.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://107.170.91.122/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/postcard-2014-20140403_16495136_0002.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140403_16495136_0002&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;http://107.170.91.122/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/postcard-2014-20140403_16495136_0002.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From: Bessie Chandler, To: Marie&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dear Marie,&lt;br&gt;
&lt;span style=&#34;line-height: 1.5;&#34;&gt;Last night we heard the new “Lucille Love” Waltzes at the picture show where they were showing the “Lucille Love” motion pictures. &lt;/span&gt;Say, it is great and makes a wonderful Hesitation. Can’t wait until I get to the music store to buy a copy.&lt;br&gt;
Yours in haste,&lt;br&gt;
Bessie&lt;/p&gt;</description>
